  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF-VEI cooperation on Cholera in Harare Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cholera is endemic in the city of Harare. Responses to outbreaks are on-going and re-occurring, but there should be more focus on long-term prevention of outbreaks. This can be reached through improving the overall WASH situation in Harare, among others through improving the centralized and decentralized water and wastewater systems.</narrative>
  </description>
